    "description": "<p><strong>Tech</strong></p><p><strong>Discharged:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Close range. On a success, throw a grenade toward them that explodes on impact. The target and all creatures within Melee range of them must make a Reaction Roll (13). Targets who fail take <strong>d20+5</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency. Targets who succeed take half damage. Then place this card in your vault.</p><p><strong>Charged:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Close range. On a success, <strong>spend a Charge</strong> to throw a grenade toward them that explodes on impact. The target and all creatures within Very Close range of them must make a Reaction Roll (13). Targets who fail take <strong>d20+5</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency. Targets who succeed take half damage.</p><p><strong>Overcharged:</strong> Make a Power Roll against a target within Far range. On a success, <strong>spend 2 Charges</strong> to throw a grenade toward them that explodes on impact. The target and all creatures within Close range of them must make a Reaction Roll (13). Targets who fail take <strong>d20+5</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency. Targets who succeed take half damage. Then place this card in your vault.</p>",
